{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人方力申昨日（20日）公布老婆Maple為他懷第二胎喜訊，今日就挑戰港澳渡海泳，望刷新港澳橫渡最快紀錄！</p><p>今早清晨，小方的親朋好友及支援團隊特意於清早趕赴起點香港大嶼山雞翼角，在出海前為他送上熱烈打氣與滿滿祝福。</p><p>準備就緒的小方於下水前坦言：</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:23:55.776935+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:52:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.957244+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.957244+00:00","content_hash":"dd8d3964c634f8b66a80d4a01a4bd4db9fba5a63371359f442c24542f43db300","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}